#
# Every file in this repository is a text file, and every one of them is stored
# and checked out with LF endings. Pinning the endings here means a checkout is
# byte-identical whatever `core.autocrlf` happens to be set to on the machine
# doing the checkout, which is what makes the published run digests and the
# packaging proof reproducible.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.lib binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdb binary
